// External management (step 12.3): The process registers the on_pressure { … } handler, a normal
// block of its code, sees its names (cache); VM runs its fiber process at host memory pressure
// (PSI) or an external command - not a signal: Background processes are asked for first (*my*:
// order).
//
//
// program: pressure.vish
proc start
// expect: процесс запущен
proc step 60
proc pressure
// expect: давление: обработчиков 1
proc run
// expect: давление: кеш 5 → 0
// expect: шаг 3 кеш 0
// expect: завершён
